Z||000004||beachbomb||06-17-2001||09:04 PM||||NO problem, its located at 10950 Normandy blvd. its called JAcksonville u-pull-a-part and save. if you're on I-295, Normandy is on the west side of jax, at Normandy get off I-295 and head west 5 miles, its on the left(has a big orange fence around it). What part of Fl are you in? plmk, if you do decide to go there lmk and i might meet your there to help you out! I wouldn't wait long though, cars in this lot get moved rather quickly and replaced..later..Jim||||reg||1
